{"skill":{"slug":"productivity-automation-kit","displayName":"Productivity Automation Kit"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1774068392025,"changelog":"效率自动化工具箱 - 工作流+日程+任务管理","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":1615,"sha256":"f118d86a34f3d9a078c3d69674de36fae058278ae53465e56e63d3a6f26c6844","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/workflow-templates.md","size":3120,"sha256":"899a33c59631d67f468b103ac835294e5f92bf824889c48e680110a414b594e3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"run.sh","size":511,"sha256":"297c45b96f5a4e370e314eea74ad48f5561729af998f258c9458f6315d9f948e","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"scripts/data_automation.py","size":6997,"sha256":"0f2864f52c0b2f7120bee1839f61f0d77112b0751d5cd09273cc70725db2ad2d","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/schedule_planner.py","size":6934,"sha256":"e9869be077de54576774df7a0cef34d051e6fc2f96b7fafe61082cc2881425b6","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/task_reminder.sh","size":1299,"sha256":"9e45fb6547a5a285f0f00f987431c2b1ef7f3e1280067c6513a5deab4ce4837d","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":16407,"sha256":"b8568d4883cdd69296e3a2cfcda28cc4b92add7d8d56253cd6a77b2f8e2aaaaf","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"_meta.json","size":752,"sha256":"37f524cfead035e5aa3ca202431789fd20cd46a5a4d2c20e4ea34233f14fa766","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2203,"sha256":"e8540db58f439e464ebfb5dbf800bc59169535602511a0c6f43095db0370d0bb","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789423333881,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f51fe6762bba0a94f2022fcf1e66e4c20b74abebe0159cd33b02d9a34989da96","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f51fe6762bba0a94f2022fcf1e66e4c20b74abebe0159cd33b02d9a34989da96","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086374004},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":20,"checkedAt":1789423333881},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed productivity helper with local scripts and workflow templates, with no evidence of hidden execution, exfiltration, or system persistence.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Runtime scripts operate on user-provided local files and create local output directories or logs, which fits the stated data, scheduling, and reminder purposes.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No package installation, dependency download, installer mutation, or remote payload retrieval was found; run.sh only prints usage guidance.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Some trigger phrases and templates are broad, and several examples discuss outbound notifications, social posting, CRM, or finance workflows; these are visible templates rather than hidden automatic behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The task reminder script writes dated local log files, but no startup hooks, services, crontabs, privilege escalation, or cross-session agent behavior changes were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill is broad, but its artifacts coherently cover workflow templates, schedule planning, task reminders, and local data cleanup/reporting.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want a Chinese-language productivity automation kit. Review and explicitly approve any template that would call external APIs, send messages, publish social content, update CRM or finance systems, or write output over existing files.","findings":"[TP4] expected: Downgraded: the scanner compared individual scripts to the whole skill, but the package includes both documentation templates and separate scripts that match the declared modules.\n[LP3] expected: No allowed-tools field is present, but the artifacts do not request elevated agent tools or hidden permissions; the executable content is local CLI code.\n[SQP-1] expected: Broad productivity trigger phrases could cause over-selection, but this is a usability/scoping note rather than evidence of unsafe behavior.\n[E1] expected: The curl example is an optional template using api.example.com and a user-supplied API token; installed scripts do not perform network transmission.\n[SDI-4] expected: Outbound communication appears in visible workflow examples; the safety text says no external API use unless credentials or explicit authorization are provided, and no automatic sender is implemented.\n[SDI-2] expected: The social publishing workflow is a visible automation template and is reasonably within broad workflow automation, though users should review any public-posting workflow before use.\n[SQP-2] expected: Local output files and logs are expected for these scripts; documentation could be clearer about overwrite and log behavior, but this is not hidden.\n[SQP-3] expected: The skill is primarily Chinese-language; this is a locale/documentation limitation, not a security concern by itself.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789423333881}}}}}